Welcome to HemOnc KB, my personal knowledge base for hematology and medical oncology. I keep brief, practical notes here for patient care, clinical learning, and board review.

I organize my notes around diseases, with additional ways in through clinical problems and treatments. This page is my starting point; some links lead to topics I have yet to write.

